# codes:
file "values.sp" deck
  title "values"
  comment " oracle: inpcom.c inp_fix_param_values (a value that is no number gets braces: numparam reads it), inpeval.c INPevaluate (a card number: 10v is 10, 2mil is 2 mil), R1 (digits as written), inp_fix_temper_in_param and R14 (a value reading temper is the B-source parser's; run: .temp 27 and 127 give vto 0.527 and 0.627)"
  param vt = 0.45
  model m1 mos1 polarity=n params=(vto=(vt * 2) kp=vt gamma=(vt + 1) lambda=-0.02 phi=2mil tox=10)
  model m2 mos1 polarity=n params=(vto=(0.5 + $temp * 1m))
